  "label": "Disgust-Based Prejudice Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that certain individuals or groups are so 'disgusting' that they require legal protection from hatred. This is a form of dehumanizing prejudice that uses physical appearance or behavior as a basis for moral exclusion and social rejection. It implicitly references real-world social phenomena where people are marginalized or discriminated against based on perceived 'unpleasantness' or 'uncleanliness'.",
